The frequency shifter DSP in this folder (src/, op1/) is te-op1-cfw's fixed-point port after Mutable Instruments
Warps' frequency shifter (https://github.com/pichenettes/eurorack, warps/dsp: the polyphase IIR Hilbert pair of
quadrature_transform.h and the shifter around it), made in coldsoldr/te-op1-cfw (ports/fx/src/shift) and released
under the same terms as the original. freq_shift.cc is coop's own (GPL-3.0-or-later with the OP-1 firmware
permission, see ../../LICENSE and ../../NOTICE); the plugin file built from them is conveyed under the GPL, which the
MIT terms allow.

